{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36210","headline":"送郑台处士归绦岩 · 方干","name":"送郑台处士归绦岩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荣啓先生挟琴去，厌寻灵胜忆岩栖。\n白猿垂树窗边月，红鲤惊钩竹外溪。\n惯采药苗供野馔，曾书蕉叶寄新题。\n古贤犹怆河梁别，未可怱怱便解携。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36210.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36210","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}